# Docker build-context excludes. The repository root is the build context for the tools/collab-cli/ci harness
# and the lean verify images (ci/Dockerfile.windows, ci/Dockerfile.linux), which publish INSIDE the container,
# so a stale host bin/obj (whose project.assets.json carries host NuGet paths) must never enter the context.
# Do NOT exclude what the builds COPY: tools/ and docs/ (the CLI embeds docs/requirements/*).
.git
tools/collab-cli/bin
tools/collab-cli/obj
tools/collab-cli/**/bin
tools/collab-cli/**/obj
tools/collab-cli/ci/results
